WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.990
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.990
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:10.530
Oscar!

00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:12.050
Oscar!

00:00:13.730 --> 00:00:14.520
Oscar!

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:17.700
Nanna, do you know where Oscar is?

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.620
Sh-She was in her room not too long ago.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:21.800
André!

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:23.040
Do you know where Oscar is?!

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:27.000
Yes, she went out riding
by herself a little while ago.

00:00:27.550 --> 00:00:29.170
Out for a ride, huh...

00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:32.850
André!

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:33.510
Yes?

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:35.550
You probably know.

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:37.470
What is she thinking?

00:00:37.780 --> 00:00:42.690
Why did she tell Lady Antoinette that
she'd like to leave the Royal Guards?

00:00:42.690 --> 00:00:43.860
Tell me, André!

00:00:43.860 --> 00:00:45.190
Tell me everything you know!

00:00:47.530 --> 00:00:48.560
I'm sorry.

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:50.780
I wasn't told anything about this matter.

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:52.480
André!

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:55.270
I keep you by her side for exactly this reason!

00:00:55.270 --> 00:00:56.240
Just tell me!

00:00:57.250 --> 00:00:59.640
This is what she said to me,

00:00:59.640 --> 00:01:01.910
''You don't have to accompany me anymore.''

00:01:01.910 --> 00:01:03.710
''Do as you wish.''

00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:05.110
What?!

00:01:10.020 --> 00:01:14.610
<i>After her break from Fersen,
Oscar was trying to change.</i>

00:01:14.610 --> 00:01:18.600
<i>She made up her mind to live more as a man.</i>

00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:21.890
<i>Instead of remaining in the Royal Guards and
being a doll that decorates the court,</i>

00:01:21.890 --> 00:01:23.900
<i>Oscar had requested Antoinette...</i>

00:01:23.900 --> 00:01:28.130
<i>...to transfer her to a more rigorously
demanding post as a military officer.</i>

